Package: cockpit-browser
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: RYDE-PLAY contributors
Description: Cockpit module for an interactive browser session
 Cockpit Headful Browser provides a Cockpit frontend and per-user session
 helper for displaying and controlling a browser window on the server.
Depends: cockpit-bridge (>= 346), python3, tigervnc-standalone-server, openbox, dbus-x11, x11-utils, xauth, wmctrl
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk, chromium-browser | chromium, fcitx5, fcitx5-pinyin, fcitx5-module-xorg
